        " \[LineSeparator]", 
        "returns the Voronoi cell about the reciprocal-lattice origin.", 
        "\n", Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{ButtonBox["FirstBrillouinZoneRegion", 
             BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> 
              "paclet:TBMethod/ref/FirstBrillouinZoneRegion"], "[", 
